# The same definition is called with different arguments and guards.

```catala
declaration scope Predicate:
  input value content integer
  output positive content boolean

scope Predicate:
  definition positive equals if value > 0 then true else false

declaration scope SummaryArguments:
  input x content integer
  output result content integer

scope SummaryArguments:
  definition result equals
    if (output of Predicate with { -- value: x }).positive then
      if (output of Predicate with { -- value: 0 - x }).positive then 1 else 2
    else 3
```
